# TravelSphere — Deep Project Analysis Report
> Generated: 2026-04-02 | Sprint 4 (Profile & Polish) Complete

---

## 1. Project Overview

**TravelSphere** is a full-stack Flutter mobile application targeting Android (and potentially iOS). It connects users to travel packages through a live Firebase backend. The app follows a user-facing consumer model with a planned admin panel (not yet implemented).

**Tech Stack:**
| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Framework | Flutter 3.x (Dart ≥3.10.7) |
| Backend — Auth | Firebase Authentication (Email/Password + Google) |
| Backend — Database | Cloud Firestore |
| Backend — Storage | Firebase Storage |
| Mapping | flutter_map + latlong2 |
| State Management | `setState` / `StreamBuilder` (no external provider for most screens) |
| Caching | cached_network_image |
| UI Aesthetic | Custom Dark Glassmorphism (GlassContainer widget) |

