## 5. Data Model

### `TravelPackage`
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | String | Firestore document ID |
| `name` | String | Package title |
| `imageUrl` | String | Network image URL |
| `price` | int | Price per person (₹) |
| `rating` | double | 0.0–5.0 |
| `duration` | String | Format: "X Days" |
| `location` | String | Destination name |
| `description` | String | Full description |
| `itinerary` | List\<String\> | Day-by-day plan |
| `locationCoordinates` | LatLng? | From Firestore `GeoPoint` |

### Firestore `users` Document
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `uid` | String | Firebase UID |
| `email` | String | User email |
| `displayName` | String | User's name |
| `photoURL` | String | Firebase Storage URL |
| `saved_package_ids` | List\<String\> | IDs of favorited packages |
| `createdAt` | Timestamp | Server timestamp |

